@startuml get_assigned_students
skinparam backgroundColor white

title Get Assigned Students - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Tutor
participant API
participant GetAssignedStudentsHandler
database Database

Tutor -> API: GET /api/tutors/me/students
API -> GetAssignedStudentsHandler: GetAssignedStudentsQuery
GetAssignedStudentsHandler -> Database: Find Tutor by UserAccountId
GetAssignedStudentsHandler -> Database: Query non-ended owned agreements and student data
Database --> GetAssignedStudentsHandler: Agreement and student rows
GetAssignedStudentsHandler -> GetAssignedStudentsHandler: Group by student\nInclude agreement title, status, rate, currency and notes
GetAssignedStudentsHandler --> API: AssignedStudentResponse[]
API --> Tutor: 200 OK

@enduml
